class_name PixelFont
extends RefCounted
## The game's pixel font: a 5x7 bitmap font built at runtime (no font file to license or import),
## 8 px a line, drawn only at whole multiples of 8 px (FIXED_SIZE_SCALE_INTEGER_ONLY) so every glyph
## pixel is a square block. HUD text gets it through settings() (LabHud._settings, the intro's
## labels); the nodes showing it draw with nearest filtering (nearest()). Characters it lacks fall
## back to the engine's default font.

## Pixels a line (7 rows of glyph and one of spacing).
const SIZE := 8
const ASCENT := 7
## Columns per glyph (bit 0 is the top row), ASCII 32..126 in order.
const GLYPHS := [
